# Velox Proxima (VP) — Deep MNIST (20 epochs)
# More depth + Dropout for regularization — targets 97%+

layer Dense (512)
layer Dense (?)
layer Dense (256)
layer Dropout (0.3)
layer Dense (128)
layer Dense (10)
train on mnist
optimizer adam lr=0.001
epochs 20
batch_size 64
loss cross_entropy
save models/mnist_deep.pt
plot all to plots/mnist_deep.png
eval on test
